      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRONTO ROCCO (1) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 509m behind Brookman Ranger (30.21) in a Grade 4/5. Can discover winning form. RAPIDO MYSTIQUE (2) was a winner (30.20) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Has a good record here at this journey. Should be in this for a long way. INCREDIBLE SHINE (4) boasts a consistent overall record including 11 wins from 53 starts, but missed the frame latest when fifth (42.96) over 715m at Cannington. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of 10 starts. Looks suited and expected to run well. SPOTLESS WAYNE (6) impressed in his fast 29.57 win last time. Looks an each way chance.",
